  "about_what_is": "What is AuroxLink?",
  "about_what_is_p1": "is a modern and customizable platform to visualize, manage and extend the capabilities of the",
  "about_what_is_p1b": "system, aimed at amateur radio operators and node operators.",
  "about_what_is_p2a": "This interface was developed by",
  "about_what_is_p2b": "known as",
  "about_what_is_p2c": "on social media, with the goal of bringing technology closer to the community in a clear and practical way.",
  "about_note_design": "Consistent design with the main dashboard: clean, readable and direct.",
  "about_name_origin": "Origin of the name",
  "about_name_origin_p1a": "The name",
  "about_name_origin_p1b": "was born as a tribute to",
  "about_name_origin_p1c": "my daughter, who is my inspiration and strength to keep creating. Just as auroras light up the sky, this system seeks to illuminate communications with an orderly and reliable visual experience.",
  "about_name_origin_x": "represents the heart of the",
  "about_system": "system",
  "about_name_origin_link": "symbolizes the connection between stations, operators and the passion for amateur radio.",
  "about_aurora_design": "Aurora in the design (my why)",
  "about_aurora_p1a": "This project is dedicated to",
  "about_aurora_p1b": "Not as a pretty phrase, but as a daily truth. She taught me that the world can feel different: that a tiny detail can be huge, and that a clear routine can be a form of peace.",
  "about_aurora_p2": "Sometimes the road is difficult. There are meltdowns that exhaust, rejections that hurt, and a future that can feel overwhelming.",
  "about_aurora_p3": "But something incredible also happens: a smile, a small sign of love, a look or a hug... and everything changes. Like when a signal becomes clean again and communication is finally understood.",
  "about_aurora_p4": "That is why AUROXLINK tries to be like that: clear, stable, predictable and kind. A place where the noise goes down and connection becomes possible.",
  "about_guiding_principles": "Principles that guide AUROXLINK:",
  "about_clarity": "Clarity",
  "about_clarity_text": "important things are seen quickly.",
  "about_predictability": "Predictability",
  "about_predictability_text": "same patterns, same logic.",
  "about_low_visual_noise": "Low visual noise",
  "about_low_visual_noise_text": "less saturation, more calm.",
  "about_kind_feedback": "Kind feedback",
  "about_kind_feedback_text": "clear states without aggression.",
  "about_accessibility": "Accessibility",
  "about_accessibility_text": "readable, coherent and easy to use.",
  "about_dedicated_footer": "Dedicated to Aurora — because a small gesture can change everything.",
  "about_recognition": "Recognition to SVXLink",
  "about_recognition_p1": "This system is based on",
  "about_recognition_p1b": "a free software created by",
  "about_recognition_p2": "It is distributed under the",
  "about_recognition_p3": "You can check its",
  "about_official_repo_here": "official repository here",
